 "text": "Hey, how's your day been so far? It depends on the wedding. For big, fancy wedding with a venue and a chef, yes, a good wedding planner is worth the money. That's a common start. A wedding plan will help you turn that chaos into a smooth day. It means the day of the wedding, from arrivals to speeches to the first dance. A good plan covers everything. It is the dream, but it also takes the headache out of it. That's real worry. A good plan will listen to your mom and make her part of the plan, too. Sneaky is often the best. A plan can even help if the couple changes their minds, because the plan is based on your preferences.",
